  "prefLabel": "Rev 3401.20 Yield tax",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 3401.20 “Yield tax” means the 10% tax assessed upon the stumpage value of wood or timber cut during a tax year pursuant to RSA 79:3. The term includes “timber tax”.\n\nSource. #10664, eff 9-4-14; ss by #14026, eff 7-16-24",
